# EDA Retail Sales

## Objective
Perform exploratory data analysis on retail sales data to understand sales patterns and customer behavior.

## Tools & Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Jupyter Notebook

## Work Performed
- Data loading and inspection
- Data cleaning
- Exploratory data analysis
- Statistical analysis
- Data visualization
- Identification of important sales patterns

## Files
- notebook/Retail_Sales_EDA.ipynb
- output/retail_sales_cleaned.csv

## Conclusion
The analysis provided useful insights into retail sales patterns and customer-related trends.
